## 7) Audit Checklist (repeatable)

### 7.1 Identify the current production selection path
- [ ] Locate the selection entrypoint
- [ ] Confirm universe source + filters
- [ ] Confirm feature set + lookbacks
- [ ] Confirm scoring and ranking rules
- [ ] Confirm target weighting + constraints

### 7.2 Validate backtests support the current logic
- [ ] Confirm backtest code uses the same selection functions
- [ ] Confirm costs/slippage assumptions are reasonable
- [ ] Confirm out-of-sample evaluation exists
- [ ] Confirm robustness tests exist and pass

### 7.3 Validate live/paper ops integrity
- [ ] Reconciliation confirms broker positions match canonical positions
- [ ] Workflows produce artifacts before email/notifications
- [ ] Failures are noisy but non-destructive
- [ ] Rollback path is documented and tested

